sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Gateway
    participant BidService
    participant RedisLeaderboard
    participant DB
    participant WebSocketBroadcaster
    participant AuctionTimer

    User->>Gateway: POST /bids (auctionId, amount)
    Gateway->>BidService: Validate and Forward
    BidService->>RedisLeaderboard: Atomic Eval (Check current highest & update if >)
    alt Bid is lower or equal
        RedisLeaderboard-->>BidService: Reject (Bid too low)
        BidService-->>Gateway: 400 Bad Request
        Gateway-->>User: Bid Rejected
    else Bid is higher
        RedisLeaderboard-->>BidService: Accept (New Highest Bid)
        BidService->>DB: Append Bid Record (Async/Sync)
        DB-->>BidService: Ack
        BidService->>WebSocketBroadcaster: Publish New Highest Bid
        WebSocketBroadcaster-->>User: Broadcast to all connected clients
        BidService-->>Gateway: 201 Created
        Gateway-->>User: Bid Accepted
    end

    loop Background Timer
        AuctionTimer->>RedisLeaderboard: Check Auction Close Time
        alt Time expired
            AuctionTimer->>BidService: Trigger Auction Close
            BidService->>DB: Finalize Auction Status
            DB-->>BidService: Ack
            BidService->>WebSocketBroadcaster: Broadcast Auction Ended & Winner
            WebSocketBroadcaster-->>User: Broadcast to all connected clients
        end
    end
